===Etymology 2===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*pomoťь}}. {{doublet|ru|по́мощь}}, a borrowing from Old Church Slavonic.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ru-IPA|по́мочь}}

====Noun====
{{ru-noun+|по́мочь|f}}

# {{lb|ru|usually|in the plural}} [[belt]], [[tape]], or [[restraint]] to hold, support, or suspend something or someone {{q|also figurative}}
# {{lb|ru|usually|in the plural}} [[suspenders]] (US), [[braces]] (Britain)
# {{lb|ru|historical|usually|in the plural}} [[leading-string]]
